request.description:
Returns count of unread notifications.

Response: { success: true, data: { unread_count: number } }

Use this for the notification bell badge. Update in real-time via WebSocket unread_count event.

Returns current user's notification preferences. Creates default preferences if none exist.

Default category_preferences:
- capa: { in_app: true, email: true }
- document: { in_app: true, email: true }
- training: { in_app: true, email: true }
- workflow: { in_app: true, email: true }
- supplier: { in_app: true, email: true }
- system: { in_app: true, email: false }

